WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.200
-Disgraced crypto mogul
Sam Bankman-Fried

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.767
has been arrested and charged
with eight criminal counts,

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:08.300
including wire fraud,
securities fraud,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.534
and money laundering

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:11.801
after the collapse
of his crypto exchange, FTX.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:14.801
The arrest comes after
right-wing pundits spent weeks

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:16.367
speculating
that the Justice Department

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:17.834
would never hold
SBF accountable

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.434
because he donated to Democrats,

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:21.634
and now Republicans
have moved on to a new,

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.934
completely contradictory
conspiracy theory.

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:25.334
They're claiming
the arrest of SBF

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:28.100
was just a ploy to keep him
from testifying to Congress.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.968
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.400
♪♪

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.601
Even if you don't know or don't
care that much about crypto,

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.300
you've probably
heard of this guy,

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.501
Sam Bankman-Fried,
who was, until recently,

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:43.334
one of crypto's
biggest rising stars.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.601
Maybe you heard about
his crypto exchange, FTX,

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.567
or is trading firm,
Alameda Research,

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:49.067
or maybe you just
caught wind of the fact

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:51.667
that one of the biggest
rising stars in tech and finance

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:54.801
was a guy who looks
the way Cheeto dust smells.

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:58.801
I mean, lookit --
that dude looks like

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:02.634
an Albuquerque
dog walker at 6:00 a.m.

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:05.367
"Come on, Nacho, buddy.
Do your business, bro."

00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:06.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.901
He looks like he should be
playing Seth Rogan's burnout son

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.801
in a Judd Apatow movie.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:13.601
Somehow, this guy tricked the
world's most influential people

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:15.100
into believing
he was a crypto visionary.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.200
Most international criminals
have ice water

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.834
in their veins,
not bong water.

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:21.467
And yet he even managed
to convince

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:23.000
the likes of Bill Clinton
and Tony Blair

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.234
to appear on stage with him
at a conference in the Bahamas

00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:27.033
where FTX was based.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:30.067
I mean, look at the disparity
between them.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.701
Here's a tip --
if you ever find yourself

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:34.100
sitting on a stage
in the Bahamas in a suit

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.968
and you look around and notice
you're sitting to someone

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:39.334
who's dressed like they forgot
to change after gym class,

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:41.000
that should br your first clue
you [bleep] up.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.234
There was a time when these two
were both regarded

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:46.601
as political trailblazers
and master tacticians,

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.467
but I think that all goes
out the window

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:50.701
once you get hoodwinked
into appearing on stage

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:52.901
with the Hobbit
who stayed behind...

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.801 --> 00:01:57.667
...in the Shire because
he was busy playing Wii Tennis.

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:59.501
True story, you guys.

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:01.968
SBF was in a deleted scene
in "Lord of the Rings"

00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:04.334
where he pitches the Fellowship
on a crypto exchange,

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:07.834
and even Gollum is like,
"No, thanks. I'll pass."

00:02:07.834 --> 00:02:09.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:12.033
"Smeagol also thinks
it smells funny."

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:15.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.267
Actually, that deleted-scene
thing's not a true story,

00:02:18.267 --> 00:02:19.801
because if you're familiar
with "Lord of the Rings,"

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:21.567
you know, they didn't
delete any scenes.

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:22.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:24.767
It's the only movie

00:02:24.767 --> 00:02:27.634
where the extended version
is somehow shorter.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.501
Anyway, it turns out
it was all a lie.

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:33.167
In a hearing, FTX's new C.E.O.
said the company had committed

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:35.400
what he called
"old-fashioned embezzlement."

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:39.033
FTX's balance sheet was
allegedly just a house of cards,

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:41.467
and now it's all come
crashing down.

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:43.200
-Breaking news --
Sam Bankman-Fried,

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.901
the founder of the failed
cryptocurrency exchange FTX,

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:49.801
has been arrested in the Bahamas
just one month

00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:52.634
after the spectacular collapse
of his company.

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:55.367
-The Securities and Exchange
Commission says Bankman-Fried

00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:57.667
is charged with
defrauding customers

00:02:57.667 --> 00:02:59.067
out of billions of dollars

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:02.100
and orchestrating a massive,
years-long fraud.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.467
They also say he diverted
billions of dollars

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:07.334
from the customer funds
for his own personal benefit.

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:10.000
-Billions of dollars
have not been accounted for

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.200
since FTX collapsed.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.701
-Oh, are
billions of dollars missing?

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:15.200
Have you checked the fanny pack

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.467
where his weed dealer
keeps all his tips?

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:21.968
"Whoa! SBF gave me
a billion-dollar tip.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:24.634
Looks like someone's getting
new beaded curtains."

00:03:24.634 --> 00:03:26.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.300
Sal wrote that joke,

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.100
so if you're wondering
if Sal smokes weed,

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.100
the answer is a resounding no.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:37.901
His reference for a weed dealer
is beaded curtains,

00:03:37.901 --> 00:03:40.534
which I think he got from, what,
an old "Dragnet" episode?

00:03:40.534 --> 00:03:41.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.868 --> 00:03:45.000
That joke technically counts
as a clean drug test.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.334 --> 00:03:48.400
Sal, you know what weed dealers
have these days?

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.767
Cashiers.
All right, buddy?

00:03:50.767 --> 00:03:52.067
Also, I can't believe this guy

00:03:52.067 --> 00:03:53.734
thought he could hide out
in the Bahamas.

00:03:53.734 --> 00:03:56.100
Usually when you think
of international fugitive,

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.667
you imagine
a stylish jewel thief,

00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:59.534
not a dude in a T-shirt
that clearly came out

00:03:59.534 --> 00:04:01.167
of a cannon
at a basketball game.

00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:03.567
I mean, dude was supposed
to be a billionaire,

00:04:03.567 --> 00:04:05.434
but he looks like he was
thrown naked into a Goodwill

00:04:05.434 --> 00:04:07.100
and given 90 seconds
to get dressed.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:11.767
Now, again, just to give you
an idea of how much of a scam

00:04:11.767 --> 00:04:14.067
SBF's crypto exchange
allegedly was,

00:04:14.067 --> 00:04:17.033
the new CEO, who has been
installed to clean things up

00:04:17.033 --> 00:04:20.234
after SBF's fall from grace,
is the same guy who came in

00:04:20.234 --> 00:04:23.400
to clean up Enron
after its collapse in 2001.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.734
And in addition to accusing
FTX of embezzlement,

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:27.734
that guy also said recently...

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:47.300
You know it's bad
when even the guy

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:50.000
who had to clean up
the Enron scandal is horrified.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.634
The only way
this could get any worse

00:04:52.634 --> 00:04:54.534
is if we found out that --
I don't know --

00:04:54.534 --> 00:04:56.634
one of the key proponents
of the Iraq war

00:04:56.634 --> 00:04:59.133
was somehow connected to --
oh [bleep]

00:04:59.133 --> 00:05:00.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.701 --> 00:05:02.400
Also, once again,
why did it take

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.434
until now for someone
to figure out that this dude

00:05:05.434 --> 00:05:08.167
was grossly inexperienced
and unsophisticated?

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:11.067
Look, I know I'm hosting
a network television show

00:05:11.067 --> 00:05:12.868
dressed like I'm about
to go cut down

00:05:12.868 --> 00:05:14.467
the Rockefeller Christmas tree,
but...

00:05:14.467 --> 00:05:15.801
[ Laughter ]

00:05:15.801 --> 00:05:17.634
...wasn't it nice
when con artists

00:05:17.634 --> 00:05:19.701
put a little more thought
into their outfits?

00:05:19.701 --> 00:05:22.200
I mean, in "Music Man,"
Harold Hill had a straw hat

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.334
and a nice bow tie,
so when he ripped off,

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:26.200
you didn't have to feel bad
about getting tricked.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.300
But now it's all, "I dress
like a record producer,"

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.734
or, "I dress like Steve Jobs,"

00:05:29.734 --> 00:05:31.767
or, "I dress like the kid
at the skate park

00:05:31.767 --> 00:05:33.133
who has the most expensive board

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:34.300
but just stands
against the fence,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.100
not doing any tricks."
Anyway...

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.400
Part of the reason
SBF's companies were scams

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.200
is that a significant portion
of the balance sheet

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.601
was reportedly held
in a new crypto token

00:05:44.601 --> 00:05:46.300
they themselves just made up.

00:06:00.968 --> 00:06:03.367
They just made it up
and pretended it was valuable.

00:06:03.367 --> 00:06:05.000
I mean,
try that sometime yourself.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.467
See how that goes.
It won't work.

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:09.734
Unless you invest
in my new crypto token,

00:06:09.734 --> 00:06:11.801
Seth Coin.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:11.801 --> 00:06:14.167
Seth Coin
is an innovative new currency

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:17.567
that allows you to take control
of your financial future.

00:06:17.567 --> 00:06:19.701
To get started,
simply wire all of your money

00:06:19.701 --> 00:06:22.400
to the routing number
listed below, and voilà!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.067
You'll be able to pay
all your bills,

00:06:24.067 --> 00:06:27.067
like your rent or your
utilities, in Seth Coin.

00:06:27.067 --> 00:06:29.267
And if your landlord doesn't
accept Seth Coin as payment,

00:06:29.267 --> 00:06:31.601
just show him a picture of me
dressed like this,

00:06:31.601 --> 00:06:34.000
and I think...
[ Laughter ]

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.601
...he'll change his tune.

00:06:35.601 --> 00:06:38.501
-Seth! Seth! I'd like to buy
one of your Seth Coins.

00:06:38.501 --> 00:06:39.868
-You would?
-Yes.

00:06:39.868 --> 00:06:41.968
And I will give you
10 Wally bucks for it.

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:43.334
You got a deal...

00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:45.501
-...sucker.
-Sucker.

00:06:45.501 --> 00:06:47.467
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.467 --> 00:06:49.934
SBF also tried very hard

00:06:49.934 --> 00:06:51.634
to ingratiate himself
with politicians,

00:06:51.634 --> 00:06:52.801
and he cozied up
to power brokers

00:06:52.801 --> 00:06:54.000
in both parties.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.667
He reportedly spent $40 million
on the midterms,

00:06:56.667 --> 00:06:57.767
mostly to help Democrats,

00:06:57.767 --> 00:06:59.701
although he claimed
in an interview

00:06:59.701 --> 00:07:01.067
that he gave about
the same amount

00:07:01.067 --> 00:07:03.167
to Republicans through
unaccountable dark money.

00:07:03.167 --> 00:07:06.033
Nonetheless, the donations
led many right-wingers

00:07:06.033 --> 00:07:08.567
to speculate the Democrats
and the Biden administration

00:07:08.567 --> 00:07:10.734
would never hold
SBF accountable,

00:07:10.734 --> 00:07:13.501
like Twitter C.E.O. Elon Musk,
who said last month,

00:07:13.501 --> 00:07:17.000
"SBF was a major Dem donor,
so no investigation."

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.701
But, hey, if there's anything
we've learned about Elon Musk

00:07:18.701 --> 00:07:19.734
since he bought Twitter,

00:07:19.734 --> 00:07:21.767
it's that the man
is always right.

00:07:21.767 --> 00:07:24.434
Like when he changed
Twitter's verification system

00:07:24.434 --> 00:07:26.400
and accidentally allowed people
to imitate brands

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.167
which somehow led to Super Mario
telling me to go [bleep] myself.

00:07:29.167 --> 00:07:30.334
[ Laughter ]

00:07:30.334 --> 00:07:32.367
Oh, why?

00:07:32.367 --> 00:07:34.467
Because I said
Peach was too good for you?

00:07:34.467 --> 00:07:37.033
Oh!
Then why do you keep

00:07:37.033 --> 00:07:39.400
letting her get kidnapped
by a [bleep] turtle?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:42.968 --> 00:07:45.901
So, Musk got that one wrong.
And to add insult to injury,

00:07:45.901 --> 00:07:48.467
he also reportedly lost his spot
as the world's richest man

00:07:48.467 --> 00:07:51.367
the same week it was reported
that Twitter hasn't paid rent

00:07:51.367 --> 00:07:53.200
on its offices in weeks.
I'm sorry, Elon.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.868
Guess you should have invested
in Seth Coin

00:07:55.868 --> 00:07:57.434
when you had the chance.

00:07:57.434 --> 00:07:59.200
So that was
the first conspiracy theory --

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.300
Democrats would never
investigate SBF

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.434
because he donated to them.

00:08:02.434 --> 00:08:04.133
But now that SBF
has been arrested,

00:08:04.133 --> 00:08:06.701
Republicans have moved on
to a second conspiracy theory.

00:08:06.701 --> 00:08:09.667
The arrest was actually
just a ploy to stop SBF

00:08:09.667 --> 00:08:11.767
from testifying at a House
hearing on Tuesday.

00:08:11.767 --> 00:08:13.667
-Why is the Biden
Justice Department,

00:08:13.667 --> 00:08:17.667
why are they filing charges
and seeking this extradition

00:08:17.667 --> 00:08:20.501
before he had the opportunity
to testify tomorrow?

00:08:20.501 --> 00:08:22.634
Why wouldn't they
want him to testify?

00:08:22.634 --> 00:08:25.267
-Congressman Lee Zeldin
telling Fox News,

00:08:25.267 --> 00:08:28.567
"House Republicans were ready
to grill him six ways to Sunday.

00:08:28.567 --> 00:08:30.267
Now breaking tonight,"
meaning last night,

00:08:30.267 --> 00:08:32.067
"SBF was just arrested.

00:08:32.067 --> 00:08:34.901
Why not allow him
to first testify tomorrow

00:08:34.901 --> 00:08:37.300
and answer our many questions
under oath?"

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:38.968
-You know, there are a lot of
people scratching their heads.

00:08:38.968 --> 00:08:41.501
They're saying,
"Why would they arrest him

00:08:41.501 --> 00:08:43.534
before
he could actually testify?"

00:08:43.534 --> 00:08:47.534
He has donated tens of millions
of dollars to Democrats.

00:08:47.534 --> 00:08:50.267
And under oath,
he would have to ask --

00:08:50.267 --> 00:08:52.567
Mr. Zeldin would ask
embarrassing questions

00:08:52.567 --> 00:08:55.734
of the Democrats
and of that crypto king.

00:08:55.734 --> 00:08:57.534
And so isn't it convenient

00:08:57.534 --> 00:09:00.868
that the prosecutors stepped in
and charged him

00:09:00.868 --> 00:09:04.300
before he could sit down
in front of Capitol Hill?

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:06.234
-All right. First of all,
I doubt Joe Biden

00:09:06.234 --> 00:09:08.300
had any involvement
in this case.

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.467
And the way I know that is,
he's 80 years old.

00:09:10.467 --> 00:09:13.501
He probably has no idea
what crypto is or how it works.

00:09:13.501 --> 00:09:15.334
I mean,
I don't even really know,

00:09:15.334 --> 00:09:16.901
and I'm only in my late 70s.

00:09:16.901 --> 00:09:18.868
You guys think...
[ Laughter ]

00:09:18.868 --> 00:09:20.634
...think I'm young
because of my youthful charm.

00:09:20.634 --> 00:09:22.400
But when I take my makeup off
after the show,

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.701
I look like I'm in Disney's
Hall of Presidents.

00:09:24.701 --> 00:09:27.000
[ Laughter ]

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.534
At least that guy wears a suit.

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:31.501
Also, the idea that Biden
somehow stopped Congress

00:09:31.501 --> 00:09:33.567
from getting to the bottom
of what happened with FTX

00:09:33.567 --> 00:09:35.167
is absurd.
You really think Congress

00:09:35.167 --> 00:09:38.267
is going to ask penetrating
questions about cryptocurrency?

00:09:38.267 --> 00:09:41.868
You guys think
89-year-old Chuck Grassley

00:09:41.868 --> 00:09:45.200
is really gonna
crack the case on crypto?

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.267
I'm sure he still prefers to pay
for everything

00:09:47.267 --> 00:09:49.801
with beaver pelts.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:49.801 --> 00:09:51.601
This is a man who once tweeted,

00:09:51.601 --> 00:09:53.868
as a sitting
United States senator,

00:09:53.868 --> 00:09:56.033
"I now h v an iPhone."

00:09:56.033 --> 00:09:58.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:01.234
You really think that same man

00:10:01.234 --> 00:10:03.234
who tweeted that
would grill Bankman-Fried

00:10:03.234 --> 00:10:05.067
on anything other
than his appearance?

00:10:05.067 --> 00:10:06.367
"Listen to me, young man.

00:10:06.367 --> 00:10:08.667
There are cameras here
so you go get yourself a tie

00:10:08.667 --> 00:10:11.033
and a haircut, and then I'll
ask my questions about --

00:10:11.033 --> 00:10:12.467
Where was it?
Hold on.

00:10:12.467 --> 00:10:14.033
The blockchain?
That can't be right.

00:10:14.033 --> 00:10:16.334
Those are just two other words
smashed together.

00:10:16.334 --> 00:10:19.100
It's a currency exchange?
Like those airport kiosks?

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.601
Those things are a rip-off.
I went to Italy in '72.

00:10:21.601 --> 00:10:24.501
I still have my lira because of
how hard they tried to screw me.

00:10:24.501 --> 00:10:26.067
Should we take a break
for lunch?

00:10:26.067 --> 00:10:27.767
I'll have two soups."

00:10:27.767 --> 00:10:30.434
[ Laughter ]

00:10:30.434 --> 00:10:32.934
Any time Congress holds hearings
about anything tech-related,

00:10:32.934 --> 00:10:34.467
it's a disaster,
as we've discussed

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.701
from previous hearings
on Facebook or Google.

00:10:36.701 --> 00:10:39.200
They don't even know the first
thing about modern technology.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.801
-How do you sustain
a business model

00:10:40.801 --> 00:10:43.100
in which users
don't pay for your service?

00:10:45.434 --> 00:10:47.067
-Senator, we run ads.

00:10:47.067 --> 00:10:49.234
-I have a 7-year-old
granddaughter

00:10:49.234 --> 00:10:52.667
who picked up her phone
before the election,

00:10:52.667 --> 00:10:56.234
and she's playing a little game,
kind of game a kid would play,

00:10:56.234 --> 00:10:59.133
and up on there pops a picture
of her grandfather.

00:10:59.133 --> 00:11:00.767
And I'm not going to say
into the record

00:11:00.767 --> 00:11:02.968
what kind of language
was used around

00:11:02.968 --> 00:11:05.834
that picture of her grandfather,
but I'd ask you,

00:11:05.834 --> 00:11:08.267
how does that show up
on a 7-year-old's iPhone

00:11:08.267 --> 00:11:11.501
who's playing a kids game?

00:11:11.501 --> 00:11:14.167
-Congressman, iPhone is made
by a different company,

00:11:14.167 --> 00:11:16.133
and so, you know, I mean...

00:11:16.133 --> 00:11:17.567
-It might've been an Android.

00:11:17.567 --> 00:11:20.567
It's just -- it was
a hand-me-down of some kind.

00:11:20.567 --> 00:11:22.667
-"It might have been
an iPhone or an Android,

00:11:22.667 --> 00:11:24.400
or maybe it was a Fisher-Price.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.968
Whenever I -- Whenever
I turned it on, it played

00:11:26.968 --> 00:11:29.767
'Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star.'
Does that help?"

00:11:29.767 --> 00:11:32.501
So Republicans and Fox News
went from claiming Democrats

00:11:32.501 --> 00:11:35.133
wouldn't investigate SBF
because they're corrupt

00:11:35.133 --> 00:11:37.400
to SBF only got arrested
because Biden's corrupt.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:38.701
None of it makes any sense,
of course.

00:11:38.701 --> 00:11:41.300
The reality is,
the FTX collapse

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.133
was evidence
of a broader failure

00:11:43.133 --> 00:11:45.133
the entire political
and financial world

00:11:45.133 --> 00:11:47.234
needs to reckon with.
Although I have my doubts

00:11:47.234 --> 00:11:49.033
that Republicans in Congress
will get to the bottom of it,

00:11:49.033 --> 00:11:51.834
these guys can barely figure out
how to play "Candy Crush" on...

00:11:51.834 --> 00:11:53.133
-...a 7-year-old's iPhone.

00:11:53.133 --> 00:11:55.033
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:55.033 --> 00:11:58.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

